<title>USA: Mobil says Illinois refinery unit idled.</title>
<headline>Mobil says Illinois refinery unit idled.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>A brief fire idled a 65,000 barrel per day catalytic hydrodesulphurization unit at Mobil Corp's Joliet, Ill., refinery, a spokeswoman said on Monday.</p>
<p>The fire, which was extinguished by refinery firefighters in about 20 minutes, should have no impact on deliveries from the 188,000 barrel per day refinery, the spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>&quot;We don't anticipate any impact on supplies,&quot; she said.</p>
</text>
